    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9778" root="حيك" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَيَّاكٌ</span></b>  and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَيَّاكَةٌ</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَائِكٌ</span>; for the former,
in two places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  The latter also signifies <i>A
female ostrich;</i> as being likened to the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَائِك</span> in
her [manner of] walking. (TA.)

